<title>GERMANY: VIAG says made record profit in 1996.</title>
<headline>VIAG says made record profit in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German diversified utility VIAG AG said on Friday net profit reached a record high in 1996 without providing a precise figure.</p>
<p>The company had net profit of 1.32 billion marks in 1995.</p>
<p>--Bonn Newsroom, (49-228) 26097150</p>
</text>
